{
  "$comment": [
    "The single route registry. Generated from, never duplicated.",
    "",
    "The delta map requires the routing table be generated from one registry so that",
    "AGENTS.md and the checkers cannot drift. Three consumers read this file:",
    "  1. scripts/generate-routes.mjs renders the AGENTS.md routing tables;",
    "  2. scripts/check-preflight.mjs maps changed files to required routes;",
    "  3. the starter's AGENTS.md will render the app-axis table (pass 3).",
    "",
    "Two axes, because they answer different questions. A framework route answers",
    "'which part of appcraft am I changing'. An app route answers 'what kind of",
    "product work is this' — which is what a user's first prompt after `create`",
    "actually is, and what the framework-axis table alone could never route."
  ],
  "axes": {
    "framework": {
      "label": "Framework routes",
      "appliesTo": "Work on appcraft itself, in this repository.",
      "validateDocuments": true
    },
    "app": {
      "label": "Application routes",
      "appliesTo": "Work inside an app generated by `npx @nsdesign/appcraft create`.",
      "validateDocuments": false,
      "$comment": "Documents are paths inside a generated app; they do not resolve here."
    }
  },
  "routes": [
    {
      "id": "kernel",
      "axis": "framework",
      "surface": "projection envelope, retention, eviction",
      "plan": "docs/design/appcraft-core-architecture.md",
      "implementation": "docs/decision-contract.md",
      "verification": "docs/verification.md",
      "paths": ["^src/appcraft/kernel/"],
      "skills": ["projection-modeling", "writing-plans"]
    },
    {
      "id": "schema",
      "axis": "framework",
      "surface": "composition schema, Zod integration, bindings",
      "plan": "docs/design/appcraft-core-architecture.md",
      "implementation": "docs/decision-contract.md",
      "verification": "docs/verification.md",
      "paths": ["^src/appcraft/schema/"],
      "skills": ["projection-modeling", "writing-plans"]
    },
    {
      "id": "store",
      "axis": "framework",
      "surface": "Jotai facade, undo grouping, persistence",
      "plan": "docs/design/appcraft-core-architecture.md",
